# 5. PLAYER RULES

Every player has:

- A UUID.
- A username.
- A profile picture URL.
- Health.
- Points.
- A map position.
- An alive/dead status.
- A world peace vote.
- An admin status.

Initial health is 3.

Health cannot exceed 3.

Players can convert points into health.

The exact conversion rate must be confirmed and centralized in the game rules configuration.

Players receive 1 point at the beginning of every new round.

Dead players:

- Are displayed as dead in the player list.
- Cannot submit actions.
- Cannot move.
- Cannot attack.
- Cannot build.
- Cannot otherwise interact with the game as active players.
- Can only observe the game.

When a player's health reaches 0, they die.

Record one death in their statistics.

Their character must be removed from the active player list on the map, while their dead status remains visible in the player list.

