# 10. BUILDING VISIBILITY AND COLLISION

Normal buildings such as banks, outposts, and nuclear silos must be visible to every player and block movement on top of their square.

Mines must only be visible to their owner.

All attackable buildings can be attacked.

The map must account for building collision.

The mine explicitly does not block movement.

Building placement cannot occur underneath a player.

